  "title": "The green mining technology leap in northern Sweden",
  "summary": "Recently, HYBRIT, a Swedish green steel venture announced the delivery of the world’s first fossil-free steel or “green steel” to carmaker, Volvo. A few weeks later, Mercedes-Benz also announced their plans to use green steel. A remarkable achievement on all accounts and an optimistic nod for the future. This has been made possible due to a strong history of innovation in Sweden.",
